.TH SIGMA_DIFFERENCE 1 2000-1月 "genome.delta_star_profile" "genome.delta_star_profile"
.SH NAME
genome.delta_star_profile \- Sliding window \fBdelta*\fR profile: the delta-difference between each local
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIgenome.delta_star_profile(\fBgenome\fR as <generic> FastaSeq, 
\fBcompare\fR as <generic> FastaSeq, 
\fBwindowsSize\fR as integer = 1000);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Sliding window \fBdelta*\fR profile: the delta-difference between each local
 window of the genome and the comparison sequence.

 PERFORMANCE: implemented with the incremental window count matrix
 (O(1) update per slide + O(16) distance per sample), and the comparison
 sequence signature is built only once.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBgenome\fB \fR\- the query genome sequence. 
.PP
.PP
\fBcompare\fB \fR\- the comparison genome sequence. 
.PP
.PP
\fBwindowsSize\fB \fR\- the sliding window size in bp, default 1kb. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
profile rows ordered by the site position, an array of [WindowDelta](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.Analysis.SequenceTools.DNA_Comparative.WindowDelta)
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
sigma_difference
